  37               /THIS ROUTINE LEAVES WITH INTERRUPTS OFF AND DEVICE SELECTED
  38               /AND READY.
  39               /THE NEW UNIT NUMBER (0-7) IS IN THE AC.
  40               /THE UNIT  NUMBER IS IN BITS 8-11 OF THE AC.
  41               /RETURN 1 IS MADE IF THE UNIT IS NOT READY.
  42               /CINUSE IS SET TO 1.
  43               /THE HANDLER MUST NOT ALREADY BE IN USE.
  44               /THE DATA FIELD IS INTERROGATED
  45               /AND A RETURN CIF CDF IS BUILT
  46               /AND STORED IN LOCATION RETCIF
